DESCRIPTION:Want to gain experience and confidence to become a more effec
 tive public speaker? Whether you are preparing for a presentation for cl
 ass or a conference or just want to grow more comfortable in front of an
  audience\, you are invited to monthly public speaking practice sessions
  at the Commons Library. What to expect: You will speak for up to 10 min
 utes in front of a supportive audience of university staff and fellow pa
 rticipants. You can bring a presentation you are working on or be given 
