SUMMARY:Chandrashekhar Khare - Book Reading: Chasing (a) Conjecture: Insi
 de the Mind of a Mathematician
DESCRIPTION:This Event is Open to the Public Book Reading Chasing (a) Con
 jecture: Inside the Mind of a Mathematician Q&A moderated by Akshay Venk
 atesh School of Mathematics\, IAS. Chandrashekhar Khare is a professor o
 f mathematics at UCLA. Together with Jean-Pierre Wintenberger\, he prove
 d Serre’s conjecture\, which connects Galois representations and modul
 ar forms\, two central objects in number theory. His memoir\, Chasing (a
 ) Conjecture\, tells the personal story behind this work.\nhttps://www.p
 rinceton.edu/events/2026/chandrashekhar-khare-book-reading-chasing-conje
 cture-inside-mind-mathematician
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/chandrashekhar-khare-book-readi
 ng-chasing-conjecture-inside-mind-mathematician
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
