SUMMARY:At the Wedding by Bryna Turner
DESCRIPTION:Pixley Marquardt ’27 co-directs and performs in At the Wedd
 ing. (Photo by Ron Wyatt) In this raucous and bittersweet comedy\, Carlo
  finds herself at her ex-girlfriend’s wedding to… some guy. Determin
 ed to cause a scene\, Carlo guides the audience through a series of cyni
 cally hilarious exchanges with the many faces of the party. As she tries
  to rock the boat\, will she be able to see beyond her heartache and rec
 ognize the true character of the people around her? Or will she sink und
 er the weight of old habits\, resolute in her bitter perceptions of love
 ?Featuring senior Pixley Marquardt and co-dir\nhttps://www.princeton.edu
 /events/2026/wedding-bryna-turner-1
