SUMMARY:Responsible AI: Crafting a Research Dataset
DESCRIPTION:We'll cover assembling gathered materials and structured data
  into an actual research dataset or database\, building a small end-to-e
 nd pipeline you could rerun from scratch\, and working iteratively from 
 a simple version to a more complete one rather than trying to get everyt
 hing right in a single pass. We'll also return to the habits of manual r
 eview and code review\, and to the harder judgment calls: recognizing wh
 en an AI-assisted approach has gotten away from you. Participants will c
 ome away with a reusable\, end-to-end dataset-building workflow they can
  apply directly to their own research m\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/event
