  sacred cantatas\, the culmination of a course taught jointly by Gabriel
  Crouch and Wendy Heller.Bach wrote hundreds of cantatas for the Luthera
 n liturgy\, and they remain among his most enigmatic works. In his own d
 ay they were sung almost exclusively by the men and boys of his choirs. 
