 wals in the Transmission of Learning\, explores how knowledge is transmi
 tted and renewed across generations\, cultures\, and disciplines. Throug
 h presentations\, panels\, and workshops\, the symposium examines how ma
 nuscripts\, books\, arts\, crafts\, and embodied practices shape teachin
